radial-keys (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add four complete action profiles and support user-created profiles.
  * Show action descriptions when hovering over menu icons.
  * Disable activation in full-screen windows and pass the mouse button through.
  * Make Flatpak built-in desktop actions run against host applications.

