radial-keys (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep activation enabled while changing the trigger button.
  * Hide windows from the taskbar while the full-screen radial menu is open.
  * Provide four ready-to-use actions for new configurations and disable
    keyboard activation by default.

